%% ===== 关键流程 1：聊天室流式（打字机）回复 =====
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Room as ChatRoomPage
    participant Svc as ChatApiService
    participant LLM as LLM (SSE)
    participant Parser as SseParser
    participant DB as Hive(messageBox)

    User->>Room: 发送消息 (_sendMessage)
    Room->>Room: _runAiRound → _generateAiReply
    Room->>Room: 创建内存态 Message(空内容, 不落库)
    Room->>Room: setState(_streamingMessage = msg)
    Room->>Svc: streamChatMessage(messages, config)
    Svc->>LLM: POST /chat/completions (stream:true)
    loop 每个 SSE 分块
        LLM-->>Svc: 字节流 (ResponseBody.stream)
        Svc->>Parser: ingest(行文本)
        Parser-->>Svc: ChatStreamEvent(token, delta)
        Svc-->>Room: yield token
        Room->>Room: msg.content += delta; setState; 滚动到底
    end
    LLM-->>Svc: data:[DONE]
    Svc-->>Room: ChatStreamEvent(done, fullContent)
    Room->>Room: 解析 @提及 → mentionedAiIds
    Room->>DB: put(最终 Message)  ← 仅完成时持久化一次
    Room->>Room: _delay 后下一发言者 / 收尾

%% ===== 关键流程 2：对话导出 / 分享 =====
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Set as SettingsPage / ChatRoomPage
    participant Exp as ExportPage
    participant Svc as ConversationExportService
    participant PP as path_provider
    participant SP as share_plus

    User->>Set: 点击「导出对话」
    Set->>Exp: 打开导出页（可选预选群组）
    User->>Exp: 选择群组 + 格式(MD / JSON)
    Exp->>Exp: 弹安全提示(对话不含 API Key，明文存本机)
    User->>Exp: 确认导出
    Exp->>Svc: toMarkdown / toJson(group, messages, charById)
    Svc-->>Exp: String / Map
    Exp->>Svc: saveToFile(content, fileName)
    Svc->>PP: getApplicationDocumentsDirectory()
    PP-->>Svc: dir
    Svc->>Svc: 写文件 chat_group_exports/...
    Exp->>Svc: share(file)  [可选]
    Svc->>SP: Share.shareXFiles
    Exp-->>User: 提示已保存路径 / 系统分享面板
